:: Bloomshore Living Room
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-living-room", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You stand in the living room. Grandma's things are neatly arranged; <<Caleb>>'s DAA jacket is draped over a chair.

<<icon "bedroom">><<link "Go to Bedroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Bedroom">><</link>>
<<gap>>
<<icon "apartment-ml-door">><<link "Leave Home <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</link>>

:: Bloomshore Home Entry
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<goto "Bloomshore Living Room">>
